Z||000004||87FieroGTx||08-06-2001||07:08 PM|||| I love both but for the price of a nice 88 Vette ($9,000?) you could go out and get a Fiero with body DMG ($1,000) or less, a Finale/Fino body ($6,000) and a hopped up 3.4 ($2,000) now there's a good looking car with 220HP, runs 13's, And you will have a unique car.<P> If you go Vette you will be fast and have a great looking car but EVERYONE has a Vette!!||||reg||1
